flowchart TD
    USER[Usuario] --> FRONT[Frontend Next.js / React / TypeScript]
    FRONT --> HTTP[Cliente HTTP Axios]
    HTTP --> CONFIG{NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL}

    CONFIG -->|Backend configurado| EXPRESS[API Express]
    CONFIG -->|Padrao /api| FAKE[Fake API Next.js]

    subgraph BACKEND["Backend principal - Node.js / TypeScript"]
        EXPRESS --> MIDDLEWARE[Middlewares: Helmet, CORS, JSON e IDs]
        MIDDLEWARE --> ROUTES[Rotas Express]
        ROUTES --> PRODUCT_ROUTE[ Rota /produtos ]
        PRODUCT_ROUTE --> CONTROLLER[ProdutosController]
        CONTROLLER --> SERVICE[produtoService]
        SERVICE --> REPOSITORY[produtoRepository]
        REPOSITORY --> PRISMA[Prisma Client]
        EXPRESS -.-> ERROR[Middleware global de erros]
    end

    PRISMA --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]

    PRISMA -.->|Resultado da consulta| REPOSITORY
    REPOSITORY -.->|Dados| SERVICE
    SERVICE -.->|Resultado do negocio| CONTROLLER
    CONTROLLER -.->|Resposta HTTP| EXPRESS
    ERROR -.->|Resposta de erro| EXPRESS
    EXPRESS -.->|Resposta HTTP| HTTP
    HTTP -.-> FRONT

    FAKE --> MOCK[Mocks e dados locais]
    MOCK -.-> FRONT

    classDef frontend fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef backend fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef database fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    classDef auxiliary fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#581c87

    class USER,FRONT,HTTP frontend
    class EXPRESS,MIDDLEWARE,ROUTES,PRODUCT_ROUTE,CONTROLLER,SERVICE,REPOSITORY,ERROR backend
    class PRISMA,DB database
    class FAKE,MOCK,CONFIG auxiliary
